hostname router
!
no aaa root
!
username admin privilege 15 role network-admin secret admin
!
ip routing
!
interface Ethernet1
   description trusted-client subnet
   no switchport
   ip address 192.168.10.1/24
   no shutdown
!
interface Ethernet2
   description untrusted-attacker subnet
   no switchport
   ip address 192.168.20.1/24
   no shutdown
!
interface Ethernet3
   description downstream-server subnet
   no switchport
   ip address 192.168.30.1/24
   no shutdown
!
end
